  "result": "I fixed it in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts`: the board's query now leaves out archived issues. I haven't run the tests.\n\n**Cause:** `listBoardColumns` is the function that loads the cards for each board column. It filtered only by organisation and project and never checked whether an issue was archived. Its own comment said \"live rows only\", but the code didn't do that. The issue list, per-project counts and exports all use `livePredicate`, the shared check that drops archived rows, and that's why they were already correct.\n\n**Fix:** I added `livePredicate(issues.archivedAt, {})` to that query, so the board now filters the same way as the rest of the product.",
